  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃、おはよう\r\nすまないな、急にスケジュール入れちゃって",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "いえっ、全然……っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日、PR動画の撮影ができれば、\r\n今週中には２８３のWEBチャンネルで公開できそうでさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今週中に……そんなに早くできるんですね……っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、関係者に頼んでみたら、\r\n素早く動いてくれてな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……プロデューサーさんに\r\nいろいろお任せしてしまってすみません……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それこそ全然だよ\r\n真乃の魅力を伝えていけるようにするのが俺の仕事だからな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも……\r\n動画の公開は私のわがままでもあるので……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わがままなんかじゃないさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "打ち合わせの時、どうやってPRするかを\r\n真乃から提案してくれたの、心強かったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『WEBのインタビューみたいに\r\n誰でも見れるようなことをやりたい』",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──って、俺はすごくいい考えだと思ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……\r\nあ、ありがとうございます……っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "色んな人に見て──\r\n『会える』って、楽しんでもらえる動画にしような……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "──はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020070"
  },
