  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──真乃、撮影場所まで結構かかるから、今のうちに\r\n直近のスケジュール口頭ですり合わせさせてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n──あっ、手帳を出すのでちょっとだけ待ってください",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020080"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0329",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "お待たせしました……っ\r\n大丈夫です……っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\nそしたら、真乃のスケジュールは……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確か、今日はこの撮影の後レッスンが入ってて、\r\n明日は仕事の打ち合わせ……だったかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ。……あっ……あと、\r\n来週にグルメ番組の収録が入っていますっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お！　そうだったな、すまん\r\n来週が初回の収録だったか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "は、はい……っ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……食レポ、久し振りなのでちゃんとできるかって\r\n少しドキドキしちゃいます……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃なら大丈夫\r\nそのまま自然体でいけばいいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……自然体……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "以前、出演した時、番組ディレクターさんが\r\nそういうところを気に入ってくれてな",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回はオーディションを受けてじゃなくて、\r\nシーズンレギュラーとして直接オファーしてくれたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、変に気負わず\r\nありのままの真乃で大丈夫……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……き、緊張しちゃいそうだったら──",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "前に、プロデューサーさんが\r\n言ってくれたことを思い出しますっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "深呼吸したり……っ\r\nお料理を楽しむことに専念したり……っ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……それと、\r\nピーちゃんと話すみたいに普通にすることもな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふ……はいっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、それじゃあ直近のスケジュールはこんなところかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
