    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい、そうみたいです……っ\r\n──あっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\nどうかしたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ……えっと、すぐのことではないんですけれど\r\nその、この先のことで少しだけご相談が……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、全然かまわないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すぐのことでも、この先のことでも\r\n遠慮せずに何でも気軽に相談してくれ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "は、はい……っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "先に組んでいただいたレッスンの予定で\r\n一日だけお休みが欲しい日があるんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "学校でグループ課題が出ていて、クラスのみんなと\r\n調べ物をするのに集まる日が、被ってしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait_return_L",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……うん、大丈夫\r\nそれじゃあ、別の日に調整してみるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003020240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あの……っ\r\n私のわがままで、すみません……っ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100302/1001003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、いいんだよ\r\n学校のことだって、真乃にとって大切なことだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スケジュールはなんとかできるからさ、\r\n学業も、クラスのみんなとたくさん楽しんでおいで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
